    (0xCC820000, 'lwc3', 'MIPS-I COP3', 'lwc3',
     "`lwc3 $2,0($4)` -- MIPS I Table A-37 row 6 column 3. MIPS IV gives this "
     "opcode to PREF, and PREF is what ISA_OPS said until 2026-08-27. 量: "
     "-march=mips1 REFUSES `pref` and accepts `lwc3` at the same 32 bits"),
    (0xEC820000, 'swc3', 'MIPS-I COP3', 'swc3',
